🎯Notable Innovations:
1. Atomic Portfolio Rebalancing
The Problem: DeFi portfolios require multiple transactions to rebalance, causing:

High gas costs (3x-5x individual transactions)
MEV exposure between transactions
Partial execution failures
Our Solution: We "hacked" 1inch's swap data format to enable atomic batch operations:
// Instead of: USDC→ETH (tx1), USDC→WBTC (tx2), USDC→LINK (tx3)
// We do: [USDC→ETH, USDC→WBTC, USDC→LINK] (single atomic tx)

2. Emergency Wallet Recovery (SAFU Module)
The Innovation: Built a compromise detection system that uses 1inch APIs for emergency asset evacuation:  SWAP ALL ASSETS ONCHAIN TO ETH USING 1INCH API AND TRANSFER TO SAFU WALLET

